{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n '\"'^#{1,4} '\"' PLAN.md\"","aggregated_output":"1:# PLAN: a first-person open-world mercenary game inspired by Far Cry 2\n3:## 0. How to use this plan\n15:## 1. The game on one page\n56:## 2. The world: Concession Fourteen\n142:## 3. Loop and pacing\n179:## 4. Systems\n183:### 4.1 Player\n190:### 4.2 Weapons, condition and jams\n221:### 4.3 Wounds and healing\n226:### 4.4 The fever\n240:### 4.5 Fire and wind (the star; build it early)\n268:### 4.6 Stealth and AI\n285:### 4.7 Posts, papers and the ceasefire\n292:### 4.8 Vehicles (all Rapier)\n300:### 4.9 Map, GPS, locator, monocular\n309:### 4.10 Diamonds, the Widow, safehouses\n318:### 4.11 Buddies, rescue, mercy\n332:### 4.12 Factions and world state\n336:### 4.13 Contract runner\n355:## 5. Story and writing\n357:### 5.1 Voice (narrative tone)\n392:### 5.2 Dictations (six hidden tapes, the Notary's voice, subtitled)\n403:### 5.3 The campaign\n461:## 6. Multiplayer\n479:### 6.1 The round: \"The Job\"\n491:### 6.2 Boot in a session\n533:### 6.3 Netcode\n552:### 6.4 On its own, outside a hub\n564:## 7. UI and UX\n566:### 7.1 Rules for 10 feet\n576:### 7.2 Controls\n614:### 7.3 HUD (fades when nothing is happening)\n618:### 7.4 Screens\n635:### 7.5 About & Credits\n647:## 8. Attract mode\n675:## 9. Dev mode and tunables\n707:## 10. Art direction\n709:### 10.1 The look\n717:### 10.2 Palette\n732:### 10.3 Time of day (interpolate between keys)\n745:### 10.4 Fonts\n749:### 10.5 Asset list (all procedural, in code)\n766:## 11. Animation\n786:## 12. Audio (all code, no files, no samples)\n821:## 13. Technical plan\n823:### 13.1 Stack\n827:### 13.2 Layout\n849:### 13.3 The one architecture rule: sim and view are separate\n858:### 13.4 Rendering recipes (✔ all verified, copy them)\n989:### 13.5 Rapier recipes (✔ all verified)\n1039:### 13.6 Single-file build (✔)\n1061:## 14. Testing\n1065:### 14.1 This computer: corrections and facts (✔)\n1080:### 14.2 Test hooks\n1089:### 14.3 Tiers\n1142:## 15. Build order and scale\n1178:## 16. Done checklist\n1190:### Where each TASK.md item is covered\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
