{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport secrets,json,pathlib\nnames=['Char Cry','Dry Cry','Scar Cry','Tar Cry','Ash Cry','Bar Cry','Car Cry','Rust Cry','Last Cry','Far Sigh','Far Fry','Far Dry','Far Due','Far Fine','Far Gone','Far Afield','Cry Another Day','A Cry Too Far','Fire Cry','Ledger Cry','Feral Cry','Far From Paid','Invoice Cry','Far Credit','Hard Cry','Far Flare','Far Ajar','Fever Cry','Mar Cry','Far Crier','Burn Cry','Far Outcry','Dry Season Cry','Dirt Cry','Far Smoke','Far Shy','Far Debt','Far Shot','Spark Cry','Soot Cry','Faro Cry','Fare Cry','Farewell Cry','Far Fought','Far Rust','Far Cry Me A River','A Farther Cry','Far Cries','Cry By Night','Cry And Dry']\nassert len(names)==50\nname=secrets.choice(names)\nslug=name.replace(' ','-')+'-Far-Cry-2-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-075003'\np=pathlib.Path(slug)\nfor d in ['src/data','src/core','src/sim','src/view','src/anim','src/audio','src/ui','src/input','src/net','vendor','tools/hub','tools/tests','docs','test-output']:(p/d).mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\n(p/'project.json').write_text(json.dumps({'title':name,'tagline':'Every debt leaves a mark.','basename':slug},indent=2))\npathlib.Path('PROGRESS.md').write_text(f'''# Progress — {name}\\\\n\\\\n## Deliverables\\\\n- Dev directory: \"'`{slug}/`'\"\\\\n- Single-file game: \"'`{slug}.html` (workspace root).'\"\\\\n- Exit interview: \"'`exit-interview.json` (workspace root).'\"\\\\n- Title selected with Python secrets.choice from 50 riffs.\\\\n\\\\n## Current status\\\\nRead TASK.md and all PLAN.md sections. Implementing an original first-person mercenary campaign in Concession Fourteen, procedural ink/cel art, 8 contracts + errands, all three endings, fire/wind, survival, vehicles, buddy systems, standalone/AI Hub co-op, controller UI, attract and dev tools.\\\\n\\\\n## Constraints and decisions\\\\n- TASK.md takes precedence. No subagents. No CDN at runtime; bundle Three r180, Rapier 0.19.3, fonts and original unmodified Hub client.\\\\n- All created files stay in dev folder except required root deliverables and this log. Screenshot outputs stay in dev folder per TASK.md.\\\\n- Testing toolkit cheatsheet missing at provided location; installed viewport-matrix and Playwright are available.\\\\n- Only local ephemeral ports; own processes only.\\\\n- Read official AI Hub Protocol v1 README (client 1.4.0).\\\\n\\\\n## Work remaining\\\\n1. Scaffold/build and procedural world/simulation.\\\\n2. Gameplay, campaign, UI and audio.\\\\n3. Attract, multiplayer, dev tools.\\\\n4. Tests, screenshots, fixes.\\\\n5. Final metadata, build, exit interview and report.\\\\n\\\\n## Verification / issue tally\\\\nNot yet run. Maintain detailed results in dev docs/issues-log.md.\\\\n''')\nprint(json.dumps({'title':name,'folder':slug}))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
