{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_47","type":"agent_message","text":"The first browser build renders successfully on WebGPU, and the first AI Hub harness run passes. Simulation tests caught two gameplay bugs: skipping the barge left movement disabled, and the first skiff faced toward the bank and soon stopped. Both are fixed. I’m continuing the campaign playthrough and attract-mode coverage checks.\n"}}
