{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_69","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();a=s.index('## Current status');b=s.index('## Constraints',a);s=s[:a]+'''## Current status\nGame is built and runs offline as a 3.36 MiB HTML. UI tests pass (14/14), including WebGPU, WebGL2, controller glyph switching, 10-foot menu audit, audio recipes, attract isolation, Android touch-only and iPhone WebKit Settings. Official AI Hub 2-seat smoke passed. Full multi-seat harness is running. Simulation tests pass all unit checks; the whole-campaign bot has completed C1–C8 and Read It, and a test-bot stop condition at Sell It's automatic finish was just corrected. Rerunning complete sim suite now.\n\n## Active test processes\n- \"'`node tools/test.mjs --sim` and `--hub` started most recently; poll exec sessions from conversation. No persistent external server processes; test servers clean up themselves.\n\n## Implementation notes for continuation\n- `src/sim/index.js`: deterministic simulation and full declarative campaign.\n- `src/sim/bot.js`: walks/drives/shoots/uses through all steps with input frames; only god mode is used for campaign testing. Handles Director breakdown with repair.\n- `src/view/index.js`: TSL ink/cel procedural world; r180 WebGPU and fallback tested.\n- `src/ui/index.js`: title/pause/passports/contracts/bed/shop/settings/credits/notebook/dev/map.\n- `src/net/index.js`: Hub and BroadcastChannel transports; 8 Hz compact snapshots, reliable action/fire/event batches.\n- `tools/test.mjs` is the single test command; flags --sim, --ui, --hub, --smoke. Prints only failures + a count.\n- `test-output/` contains visual artifacts, coverage and harness results. Attract coverage currently 57/66 (86%).\n- `docs/issues-log.md` is the issue tally. About JSON still needs final honest test counts and feedback updates.\n- Latest UI build passed before tiny NPC/rig and bot changes; final rebuild + whole suite is still required.\n- Known completion work: richer remote/companion presentation just added; verify real co-op and same-computer join/results, add default 4-seat fallback harness case, static collision/bridge surfaces and weather/ambient polish, docs/validator/balance tools, viewport matrix + inspect screenshots, final metadata/report and cleanup.\n\n'\"''' + s[b:];p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_69","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();a=s.index('## Current status');b=s.index('## Constraints',a);s=s[:a]+'''## Current status\nGame is built and runs offline as a 3.36 MiB HTML. UI tests pass (14/14), including WebGPU, WebGL2, controller glyph switching, 10-foot menu audit, audio recipes, attract isolation, Android touch-only and iPhone WebKit Settings. Official AI Hub 2-seat smoke passed. Full multi-seat harness is running. Simulation tests pass all unit checks; the whole-campaign bot has completed C1–C8 and Read It, and a test-bot stop condition at Sell It's automatic finish was just corrected. Rerunning complete sim suite now.\n\n## Active test processes\n- \"'`node tools/test.mjs --sim` and `--hub` started most recently; poll exec sessions from conversation. No persistent external server processes; test servers clean up themselves.\n\n## Implementation notes for continuation\n- `src/sim/index.js`: deterministic simulation and full declarative campaign.\n- `src/sim/bot.js`: walks/drives/shoots/uses through all steps with input frames; only god mode is used for campaign testing. Handles Director breakdown with repair.\n- `src/view/index.js`: TSL ink/cel procedural world; r180 WebGPU and fallback tested.\n- `src/ui/index.js`: title/pause/passports/contracts/bed/shop/settings/credits/notebook/dev/map.\n- `src/net/index.js`: Hub and BroadcastChannel transports; 8 Hz compact snapshots, reliable action/fire/event batches.\n- `tools/test.mjs` is the single test command; flags --sim, --ui, --hub, --smoke. Prints only failures + a count.\n- `test-output/` contains visual artifacts, coverage and harness results. Attract coverage currently 57/66 (86%).\n- `docs/issues-log.md` is the issue tally. About JSON still needs final honest test counts and feedback updates.\n- Latest UI build passed before tiny NPC/rig and bot changes; final rebuild + whole suite is still required.\n- Known completion work: richer remote/companion presentation just added; verify real co-op and same-computer join/results, add default 4-seat fallback harness case, static collision/bridge surfaces and weather/ambient polish, docs/validator/balance tools, viewport matrix + inspect screenshots, final metadata/report and cleanup.\n\n'\"''' + s[b:];p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
