{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_86","type":"agent_message","text":"The broader co-op checks caught a startup timing problem in the four-copy software-rendered case: graphics work delayed some network traffic and a result beyond the Hub’s grace period. I’ve moved initial traffic ahead of rendering, batched static scenery, and increased the delay between expensive session frames. I’m rerunning those cases.\n"}}
