{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_108","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('## Active test processes', '''## Latest status / remaining\n- Full sim suite most recently passed 14/14 with E2 escort and all three endings. F-list coverage 66/66. New co-op banking/drop details now need the final rerun.\n- Expanded Hub suite passed 8/9: all flagged-browser conformance cases, coordinated fire/revive/case delivery, and same-computer lobby/results pass. Default four-copy WebGL2 case hit machine memory pressure; session shadow/grass/pixel load has since been reduced and static props batched. Final rerun pending.\n- Current \"'`--ui --viewports` exec session 62820 is running. Poll it before starting another browser.\n- Art screenshots are in `test-output/art/`; read them yourself. Day/fire/night screenshots inspected; night grade, arms and two-sided sign readability improved since those images. Physical map texture error found in art run fixed by initializing Canvas2D before GPU upload.\n- No persistent server processes. Test servers are scoped to test.mjs.\n- Finish: inspect viewport outputs; rerun art images; update about.json + issue tally; build; run full test command (all tiers including viewport matrix); inspect final files; optionally delete node_modules after tests; final report must include all requested Source Information and feedback answers.\n\n## Active test processes'\"''')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
